# Alpha OS — live-session runtime — Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (resolute)
# Provenance: names verified as exact matches against the resolute
# binary-amd64 Packages indexes on archive.ubuntu.com (released 23 Apr 2026).
# gdisk, parted, ntfs-3g and exfatprogs were each independently confirmed
# present in the resolute indexes (gdisk in universe, parted/ntfs-3g/exfatprogs
# in main); they are listed, not commented out.
# VERIFY: none outstanding for this file, but note that `ntfs-3g` is in main
# and the others in universe — if the build ever restricts the components it
# enables (e.g. main-only for the installer chroot), re-check these four.

casper
laptop-detect
os-prober
usbutils
pciutils
smartmontools
gdisk
parted
ntfs-3g
exfatprogs
xdg-desktop-portal
xdg-user-dirs
xdg-utils
dbus-x11
